Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:09:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Gate lifecycle shell changes on room-mini Bash 3.2

Add a selected room-only premerge lane with fail-closed v2 consumption, fork exclusion and a pytest-process interpreter guard. Preserve scheduled and login-session coverage.

Proof: dependency selection and interpreter guard RED then focused suites GREEN. Native historical replay and exact-head CI remain required before landing.
